Horde NPC Chat Attacking Rogue
    Events
        Unit - A unit Is attacked
    Conditions
        IsUnitAlive[(Custom value of NPC_Horde_AI_Rogue)] Equal to True
        (Remaining time for NPC_Horde_AI_Rogue_TimeAttack) Equal to 0.00
        (Attacking unit) Equal to NPC_Horde_AI_Rogue
        (NPC_Horde_AI_Rogue is in Companion_Group.) Equal to True
        And - All (Conditions) are true
            Conditions
                InCinematic Equal to False
                CompanionDialogueActive Equal to False
        (Random integer number between 1 and 10) Equal to 1
    Actions
        -------- ======================= --------
        Set VariableSet CompanionDialogueActive = True
        -------- ------------------ ADJUST chat values --------
        Set VariableSet CompanionDialogueUnit = NPC_Horde_AI_Rogue
        Set VariableSet CompanionChatRandomInt = (Random integer number between 1 and 3)
        -------- ======================= --------
        -------- ======================= --------
        -------- CHAT --------
        If (All Conditions are True) then do (Then Actions) else do (Else Actions)
            If - Conditions
                CompanionChatRandomInt Equal to 1
            Then - Actions
                Cinematic - Send transmission to (All players) from CompanionDialogueUnit named (Proper name of CompanionDialogueUnit): Play HeroRogue_Attacking1 <gen> and display You picked the wron....  Modify duration: Set to 2.00 seconds and Don't wait
                Set VariableSet CompanionDialogueTime1 = (Length of (Last played sound))
            Else - Actions
                If (All Conditions are True) then do (Then Actions) else do (Else Actions)
                    If - Conditions
                        CompanionChatRandomInt Equal to 2
                    Then - Actions
                        Cinematic - Send transmission to (All players) from CompanionDialogueUnit named (Proper name of CompanionDialogueUnit): Play HeroRogue_Attacking2 <gen> and display Heh, you’re alrea....  Modify duration: Set to 1.50 seconds and Don't wait
                        Set VariableSet CompanionDialogueTime1 = (Length of (Last played sound))
                    Else - Actions
                        If (All Conditions are True) then do (Then Actions) else do (Else Actions)
                            If - Conditions
                                CompanionChatRandomInt Equal to 3
                            Then - Actions
                                Cinematic - Send transmission to (All players) from CompanionDialogueUnit named (Proper name of CompanionDialogueUnit): Play HeroRogue_Attacking3 <gen> and display For the Horde—and....  Modify duration: Set to 2.70 seconds and Don't wait
                                Set VariableSet CompanionDialogueTime1 = (Length of (Last played sound))
                            Else - Actions
        -------- ======================= --------
        Set VariableSet CompanionDialogueTimerValue = (CompanionDialogueTime1 + CompanionDialogueTime2)
        -------- ======================= --------
        Countdown Timer - Start CompanionDialogueTimer as a One-shot timer that will expire in CompanionDialogueTimerValue seconds
        Countdown Timer - Start NPC_Horde_AI_Rogue_TimeAttack as a One-shot timer that will expire in (Random real number between 15.00 and 60.00) seconds
        -------- ======================= --------
        -------- Reset values --------
        Set VariableSet CompanionDialogueTime1 = 0.00
        Set VariableSet CompanionDialogueTime2 = 0.00
        Set VariableSet CompanionDialogueTimerValue = 0.00
        -------- ======================= --------
